+      "id": "clear-signal",
+      "text": "First: a clear signal. People need a fast way to understand what you do. This usually starts with a one-line offer statement. Something like: \"I help small nonprofits organize messy operations into simple systems.\" Or: \"I help busy founders turn their expertise into clear educational content.\" A good visibility statement is short, specific, and easy to repeat.",
+      "narration": "First: a clear signal. People need a fast way to understand what you do. This usually starts with a one-line offer statement. Something like: \"I help small nonprofits organize messy operations into simple systems.\" Or: \"I help busy founders turn their expertise into clear educational content.\" A good visibility statement is short, specific, and easy to repeat."
