+    {
+      "id": "example-story",
+      "text": "For example: \"I've watched small teams lose hours every week because their systems lived across email, spreadsheets, and people's heads. After building simpler workflows in my own work, I started helping other teams organize theirs.\" That is visibility. It tells people what you care about, what you know, and what you offer, without sounding pushy.",
+      "narration": "For example: \"I've watched small teams lose hours every week because their systems lived across email, spreadsheets, and people's heads. After building simpler workflows in my own work, I started helping other teams organize theirs.\" That is visibility. It tells people what you care about, what you know, and what you offer, without sounding pushy."
