+      "narration": "Third: repeated touchpoints. Visibility rarely happens in one dramatic moment. It usually happens because people hear your message a few times in a few different places. They might see your LinkedIn headline, hear you describe your work in a conversation, notice a thoughtful post, read a short message you send, or hear someone else mention you. This is why consistency matters more than performance. You don't need to be loud. You need to be legible."
