+      "text": "Fourth: useful participation. One of the easiest ways to build early visibility is to contribute where your people already are. That could mean replying thoughtfully in a professional group, answering a question in a community, sharing one helpful lesson you've learned, or posting a small before-and-after example of your work. Visibility is not just talking about yourself. It is helping people connect your name with something useful, relevant, and trustworthy.",
+      "narration": "Fourth: useful participation. One of the easiest ways to build early visibility is to contribute where your people already are. That could mean replying thoughtfully in a professional group, answering a question in a community, sharing one helpful lesson you've learned, or posting a small before-and-after example of your work. Visibility is not just talking about yourself. It is helping people connect your name with something useful, relevant, and trustworthy."
